# .transformers-cache/ (the ~23MB SBERT ONNX model weights) is deliberately
# COMMITTED, not ignored — some dev/college networks block the Hugging Face
# hub, which otherwise silently breaks the model's first-run auto-download.
# Committing it means a fresh clone works fully offline from the start, no
# internet needed even once. See README "Fully offline / air-gapped setup".
